size.description:
size of the root disk, for example 25Gi (UpCloud's GB are taken as GiB);
10 to 1024. Built-in default: the plan's included storage, at least 25.
A disk larger than the plan's included storage is billed in full.

internetMaxBandwidthOut.description:
internetMaxBandwidthOut is the peak public outbound bandwidth in Mbit/s;
0 means no public IPv4 address (the same as networking.publicIPv4: false).
Built-in default 100.

